# Card Components
Reusable card layouts for content display.
## Base Card Component
**Location:** `Card::BaseComponent`
Foundation for all card types with header and footer slots.
### Slots
- `header` - Card header section
- `footer` - Card footer section
- Default content block - Card body
### Features
- Tokyo Night background (`bg_float`)
- Rounded corners
- Subtle shadow
- Hover effects
- Border accent
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Card::BaseComponent.new do |card| %>
  <% card.with_header do %>
    <h3>Card Title</h3>
  <% end %>
  <p>Card content goes here</p>
  <% card.with_footer do %>
    <button>Action</button>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
```
### Preview
<%= embed "card/base/showcase" %>
## Post Card Component
**Location:** `Card::PostComponent`
Displays blog post metadata with link to full article.
### Parameters
- `post:` - Post object with `title`, `description`, `published_at`, `reading_time`
- Extends `Card::BaseComponent`
### Features
- Auto-formatted dates
- Reading time badge
- Hover animation
- Direct post link
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Card::PostComponent.new(post: @post) %>
```
### Preview
<%= embed "card/post/grid" %>
## Project Card Component
**Location:** `Card::ProjectComponent`
Showcases projects with technologies and links.
### Parameters
- `project:` - Hash with `:name`, `:description`, `:technologies`, `:url`
- Extends `Card::BaseComponent`
### Features
- Technology badge list
- External link indicator
- GitHub icon integration
- Tokyo Night accent colors
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Card::ProjectComponent.new(
  project: {
    name: "Project Name",
    description: "Brief description",
    technologies: ["Rails", "Hotwire", "ViewComponent"],
    url: "https://github.com/user/repo"
  }
) %>
```
### Preview
<%= embed "card/project/grid" %>
## Card Patterns
### Grid Layout
Display multiple cards in responsive grid:
```erb
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
  <% @items.each do |item| %>
    <%= render CardComponent.new(item: item) %>
  <% end %>
</div>
```
### With Animations
Combine with animation components:
```erb
<%= render Animations::SlideUpComponent.new do %>
  <%= render Card::PostComponent.new(post: @post) %>
<% end %>
```
